# Epic: Voice Assistant VAPI Integration Modernization

## Epic Overview

Migrate voice assistants from deprecated VAPI configurations to current VAPI API, add new features, and enhance voice assistant capabilities while maintaining backward compatibility.

## Business Value

* Leverage latest VAPI features for better call quality
* Reduce voice assistant configuration errors by 60%
* Enable advanced features: intelligent transfers, sentiment analysis, function calling
* Improve voice quality and reduce latency
* Future-proof voice assistant infrastructure

## Scope

* Update VAPI API integration to latest version
* Enhanced voice configuration UI (ElevenLabs catalog updates)
* Intelligent transfer rules and human handoff
* Advanced behavior configurations (silences, interruptions, endpointing)
* Analytics and monitoring dashboard
* Backward compatibility for existing assistants

## Success Metrics

* VAPI API migration: 100% of assistants migrated
* Voice quality score improvement: +25%
* Transfer accuracy: > 95%
* Configuration time reduction: -40%
* User satisfaction with voice features: > 8/10

## Technical Considerations

* Maintain compatibility with existing voice_assistant table
* Update VAPI SDK to latest version
* Implement feature flags for gradual rollout
* Create migration scripts for existing assistants
* Test with various phone numbers and Twilio integration
* Monitor VAPI rate limits and error handling

## Dependencies

* VAPI API access and documentation
* ElevenLabs API for voice catalog
* Twilio integration for phone numbers
* Existing voice_assistant table schema

